Compilation usually requires:
% In djbfft-0.76: note changes in Makefile (JGHACKS)
cd djbfft-0.76
make clean; make
cd ..
make

Note Makefile.OSTYPE files contain platform specifics 
about JNI. Currently, Linux* and Darwin (OSX) are tested.


